Command: `cd /home/user/ruralz && CGO_ENABLED=0 go test -count=1 -overlay .../probe/overlay.json -run TestProbeTabPlain -v ./internal/config/profile/`
Output (the same at splitAt -1, 0 and 1 and with default options):
